        "original_id": "7eef8c91-0010-56d5-ba70-9d9d9cd73805",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: NFL Color Rush uniforms, third jerseys, alternate uniforms\n- Organizations: NFL, sports teams\n- Concepts: uniform allotment, home uniforms, away uniforms, color similarity\n\nFacts:\n- NFL Color Rush uniforms do not count against each team’s allowed alternate uniform allotment.\n- A third jersey, alternate jersey, third kit, or alternate uniform is worn by a sports team instead of its home outfit or away outfit.\n- Sports teams often use a third jersey or alternate uniform when the colors of two competing teams’ other uniforms are too similar for easy play.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
